{"resourceIdentifier":"4169","resourceName":"Wuwei Liangzhou Municipal Solid Waste Incineration Power Generation Project","description":"Wuwei Liangzhou Municipal Solid Waste Incineration Power Generation Project is located 2km east of Shazigou Village, Fafang Township, 11 km northeast of Liangzhou District, Wuwei City, Gansu Province, China. The project is invested and operated by Wuwei Everbright Environmental Energy Co., Ltd.. The project includes two incinerators with a daily capacity of 400 tonnes of waste respectively, an 18 MW steam turbine generator set, and related auxiliary facilities. The annual processing capacity is about 292,000 tons. Based on the annual operation of 8000 h, the annual average power generation of the steam turbine generator set under rated conditions is about 1.23×108kWh, and the annual average on-grid power is about 1.03×108kWh.","location":{"latitude":37.961944,"longitude":102.756388},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-03-31","endExclusive":"2023-05-01","endInclusive":"2023-04-30"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4169"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Gansu"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Wuwei everbright Environmental Energy Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Gansu Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"37198"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0022"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"19/01/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","v